{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"generated":true,"title":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Swipe"],"anchor":"Patterns"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Preview","level":2,"anchor":"Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"heading","text":"The patch","level":2,"anchor":"The-patch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami drives this with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reads the pinch, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":".spring","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" animates the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" row in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How it’s built","level":2,"anchor":"How-its-built"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"@GestureState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Behavior","level":2,"anchor":"Behavior"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking your fingers continuously."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Downloads","level":2,"anchor":"Downloads"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode sample"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/pr-286\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","isActive":true},{"type"